TITLE=Yomonsni - Massage - First appointment
BGIMAGE=yo-IMG_43079-5D-raw16-rawtherapee-shaped-flattened.jpg
SUBHEAD=What to expect in your first appointment

      <div class="col-12 col-md-10">
	<div class="row">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Outline</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">There have been some questions about what to expect during your first Yomonsni massage, so this is a generic outline. One of the key elements of your first session is to establish a comfortable connection and find your initial purpose and direction. As the nature of Yomonsni is deeply personal, you need to feel comfortable and connected to your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a> in order to open yourself, to follow their advice and guidance. Through the course of your development within the Yomonsni framework your purpose and goals may shift, but the first session will be about discovering and examining where your goals start, and where you are relative to them. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Beforehand</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">After making your appointment and getting directions, you should begin thinking about what it is you would like to experience and would like to work on. What are your goals for the day, for a 6 month introduction, or for your life? What elements would you like to include in the massage, whether of <a href="./body.html">Body / Yom</a>, <a href="./mind.html">Mind / Ons</a>, or <a href="./self.html">Self / Sni</a>.  </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">As you begin to think on these things, break down the elements, what are your goals and direction for development in your Yom, your Ons, and your Sni. How do you think these development goals will interact with each other?</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">The day of your appointment you should wear loose comfortable clothing, to start your relaxation as you journey to the sanctuary space.  </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Please always confirm your appointment the day before, and if something comes up in your life where you can no longer make it, please let your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a> know as soon as possible. These simple acts of respect help ensure that your Yomonsni experience is the best it can be. At this confirmation of your appointment, you can indicate any optional extras that you would like as part of your massage, including your preference for artistic expression.</p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div inner-row>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Arriving</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Upon arriving at the Yomonsni sanctuary, you will be shown the toilet, and offered a quick drink (water, coffee, tea are usually available). </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Weather cooperating to personal tolerances, your appointment will begin with a walk in the environment around the sanctuary. Some of the walking that may be conducted is in public space, but for walking solely on sanctuary grounds it is quite liberating to do so fully nude. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">Even without the walk, you should expect to be nude as soon after arrival as feasible. Clothes are a costume, and psychologically we assume the identity of the costume, distorting and projecting our true self through it. It is only when we remove the costume that we can be truly who we are. Yomonsni development requires total openness between you and your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a>, starting with the Yom and the physical removal of your costume facilitates the total openness of Ons and Sni, and starts you on the right path. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Beginning</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">For your first appointment, the session will start simply with talking, a give and take of questions and conversation. Your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a> will be taking notes through this process. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">This light conversational, interrogational period will last a while, and is a process of shared discovery of Ons and Sni.  </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	


	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">During</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">Through the course of your first Yomonsni massage, the key is a curious exploration of your Yom, Ons, and Sni. While all of it will be new to your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a>, it's quite possible that you will end up learning more about yourself even in this first session. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p> 
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	  </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Closing</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">The last part of your first Yomonsni experience is the collection of feedback by your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a>. What did you like, not like through the day. What facilitated your comfort, relaxation and pleasure. During this last phase of conversation, light refreshments will be available. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0">After all portions of your Yomonsni massage have concluded for the day, you will be given access to a shower to wash the oil off, as well as helping to ensure a return to alertness to enable safe driving. </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	    </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>



	<div class="row p-2 tw">
	  <div class="col-sm-2">
            <h2 class="section-heading mb-0 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
              <span class="section-heading-upper tw">Afterwards</span>
            </h2>
	  </div>
	  <div class="col-sm-1"></div>
	  <div class="col-sm-7 bg-faded2 p-3 rounded">
            <p class="mb-0">A few days after your first massage experience, you will be contacted to again get feedback on your session. Key questions at this point will be:  </p>
	    <p class="mb-0">Did you feel enough comfort with your <a href="../about/glossary.html#siazul">Siazul</a> that you think they will enable your future growth? </p>
	    <p class="mb-0"></p>
	    <p class="mb-0"></p>
	    <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"> </p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
            <p class="mb-0"></p>
            <p class="mb-0">&nbsp</p>
	    </div>
	</div innerrow>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>
	<div class="row p-3 tw"></div>


	
       
